==Sanskrit==

===Adjective===
{{head|sa|adjective|sc=Deva|tr=bhā́rata}}

# descended from {{term|sc=Deva|भरत|tr=bharata|lang=sa}} or the [[Bhāratas]] (applied to [[Agni]] either "sprung from the priests called Bharatas" or "bearer of the [[oblation]]")
# belonging or relating to the Bharatas
## (with {{term|sc=Deva|युद्ध|tr=yuddha|lang=sa}}, {{term|sc=Deva|संग्राम|tr=saṃgrāma|lang=sa}}, {{term|sc=Deva|समर|tr=samara|lang=sa}}, {{term|sc=Deva|समिति|tr=samiti|lang=sa}}) the war or battle of the bharatas
## (with or scil. {{term|sc=Deva|आख्यान|tr=ākhyāna|lang=sa}} with {{term|sc=Deva|इतिहास|tr=itihāsa|lang=sa}} and {{term|sc=Deva|कथा|tr=kathā|lang=sa}}) the story of the Bharatas, the history or narrative of their war
## (with or scil. {{term|sc=Deva|मण्डल|tr=maṇḍala|lang=sa}} or {{term|sc=Deva|वर्ष|tr=varṣa|lang=sa}}) "king Bharatas's realm" i.e. [[India]]
# inhabiting {{term|sc=Deva|भरतवर्ष|tr=bharata-varṣa|lang=sa}} i.e. [[India]]; [[Indic]]

====Declension====
{{sa-decl-adj|भार|त|bhāra|t|a|ī|a}}

===Noun===
{{sa-noun|tr=bhā́rata|g=m}}

# a [[descendant]] of [[Bharata]] (also in pl. for [[Bharatās]])
# (with {{term|sc=Deva|अश्वमेध|tr=aśva-medha|lang=sa}}), name of the author of Rigveda V, 27
# (with {{term|sc=Deva|देववात|tr=deva-vāta|lang=as}} and {{term|sc=Deva|देवश्रवस्|tr=deva-śravas|lang=sa}}), name of the authors of Rigveda III, 23
# [[fire]]
# an [[actor]] (compare {{term|sc=Deva|भरत|tr=bharata|lang=sa}})
# name of the sun shining on the south of {{term|sc=Deva|मेरु|tr=meru|lang=sa}}

====Declension====
{{sa-decl-noun-a-m|भार|त|bhāra|t}}

===Noun===
{{sa-noun|tr=bhā́rata|g=n}}

# the [[land]] of Bharatas i.e. [[India]] (compare above)
# the story of the Bharatas and their wars (sometimes identified with the {{term|sc=Deva|महाभारत|tr=mahā-bhārata|lang=sa}}, and sometimes distinguished from it)
# (with {{term|sc=Deva|सरस्|tr=saras|lang=sa}}) name of a lake

====Declension====
{{sa-decl-noun-a-n|भार|त|bhāra|t}}

